# The catalog builder and local API need no credentials or environment variables.
# Configure source/output/base URL with documented CLI arguments.

# Optional official DeepL translation CLI only. Export in the process environment;
# the stdlib CLI does not load .env automatically. Never commit a real key.
# DEEPL_AUTH_KEY=replace-with-your-official-deepl-api-key
# Free keys ending in :fx use api-free.deepl.com; other keys use api.deepl.com.
